    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Translation Provider**\n\nI've decided to use the Google Cloud Translation API and will integrate it within the `batch_translate.py` file. The aim is to translate an ordered list of strings. I'll focus on making the API call explicit within the script.\n\n\n**Implementing Batch Translation**\n\nI'm now writing the `batch_translate.py` script. My focus is on implementing the batch translation function. I'm importing the Google Cloud Translate client and defining a function that handles the translation, incorporating the target language and project ID parameters. I'll utilize the `translate_text` method for the actual batch operation and ensure the translated texts maintain the original order.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789818326930,
          "start": 1789818325007
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
